The canonical contributor + agent guide for this repo is [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md). Read it before making changes.

- Project root: `/-/reforged-spork`. Use absolute paths rooted there in shell commands.
- Use `/usr/local/bin/sail` for every Laravel / Docker command (never `./vendor/bin/sail`, never bare `php artisan`).
- Tests run via `/usr/local/bin/sail phpunit` only. The `test` alias is broken in this project.
